WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Keep the review in your agent. From a draft report to an evidence packet.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Add the remote endpoint. For Codex, run this command once in your terminal.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Name the draft and its evidence. Use the report profile for a claim-by-claim challenge.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The tool prepares. Your agent reviews. Privacy check, file hashes and the review request come back first.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Read the claim and its source. This review was written in the Codex session for this public example.

6
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Keep a checkable record. The tool checks citation locations and builds the Markdown packet.

7
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Keep your workflow. Keep the evidence. This core review uses your agent's own model and needs no Bounty Operator account. bountyoperator.com/mcp.
